      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey i've been running some spectral analysis on audio recordings taken near the city hall plaza and i'm seeing these consistent spikes in the sub-audible range, like 14-19Hz. they aren't accidental. the patterns repeat every 4 hours exactly. can you help me look into why a municipal building would be emitting specific frequencies in that range? it feels like something targeted.",
